# The app moved from /next/karkhana.html to the apex on 2026-09-08.
# Links to the old path were shared, and Cloudflare Pages answers every
# unmatched path with index.html at HTTP 200 — so /next/karkhana served the
# app's HTML while its relative assets (vendor/xterm.js, dist/stack.js, ...)
# resolved under /next/ and came back as that same HTML. The browser then
# executed HTML as JavaScript: the page rendered and the terminal never booted.
# Redirect the old path instead of letting it masquerade as a working app.
/next/karkhana      /   301
/next/karkhana.html /   301
/next/*             /   301
